<view class="container">
  <view class="demo-tag">Prototype · Demo Data · Local mock only</view>

  <block wx:if="{{phase === 'waiting'}}">
    <match-animation lines="{{lines}}" interval="900" binddone="onAnimationDone" />
  </block>

  <block wx:else>
    <view class="eyebrow">Signal</view>
    <view class="title result">{{title}}</view>
    <view class="subtitle">{{subtitle}}</view>

    <block wx:if="{{outcome === 'mutual' && revealCard}}">
      <view style="height: 36rpx"></view>
      <relationship-card person="{{revealCard}}" unlocked="{{true}}" signal="mutual_crush" />
    </block>

    <view class="note">
      实验说明：不会展示单方喜欢或「被拒绝」。不提供按名字查询谁喜欢过我。真实环境需后端与隐私策略，本页仅为 mutual-crush MVP 演示。
    </view>

    <view style="height: 32rpx"></view>
    <ui-button type="accent" bindtap="tryAgain">再写一组名字</ui-button>
    <ui-button type="ghost" bindtap="backHome">回到首页</ui-button>
  </block>
</view>
